Source: acp-rs-scraper
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: m3talsmith <m3talsmith@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo (>= 1.88), rustc (>= 1.88), gcc, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/m3talsmith/acp-rs-scraper
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: acp-rs-scraper
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Scrape Red Star (acp.us/rs) posts into SQLite and export them
 Logs in to https://acp.us/rs, scrapes posts, mentions and profiles for one or
 more nicks into a local SQLite database, downloads attachments, and exports
 JSON/HTML. Search, export, import and maintenance work offline.
